[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2865181266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105839#issuecomment-2865181266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105839","id":2865181266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qxzJS","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T05:36:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T05:36:34Z","body":"From my testing a while back, I can confirm that the steps to reproduce are correct.\n\nUnfortunately, it seems like, Network Filesystem has broken for C# on mobile ever since it was introduced. \n\nAs it stands right now, developing for mobile is not feasible, especially for larger projects, as your iteration cycle is entirely dependent on project export time.\n\nI hope to see this fixed soon!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2865181266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869347637","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105839#issuecomment-2869347637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105839","id":2869347637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rBsU1","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T02:14:52Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T02:14:52Z","body":"It looks like the .NET module is not initialized because the `dotnet` feature is not present. It may be that features added by EditorExportPlugins are not included in the features for projects running through the _Remote Deploy_ system.\n\nAfter I forced it to initialize the .NET module, it was able to find and initialize `libmonosgen-2.0.so`, but it was still unable to find the assembly DLLs (i.e.: `System.Private.CoreLib.dll`).\n\nThis is likely because `libmonosgen-2.0.so` is included in the `lib` directory in the APK, but the DLLs are included in the `assets` directory which I don't think is populated when _Small Deploy with Network FileSystem_ is enabled.\n\nWe may have to add the necessary files to the Network FileSystem with the `_add_custom_file` API.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869347637/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]